dations, this edition of The Monastery crafts an accessible and pleasant reading experience for modern audiences while restoring the original mastery and drama of Sir Walter Scott’s literature.\n\nCategories: Fiction	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2I77LpQFV2M/hqdefault.jpg	2025-11-21 08:35:38.092805+00	2754	\N
