racter arcs to unearth underlying meanings. - Reflection questions prompt you to engage personally with the work's messages, connecting them to modern life. - Hand‐picked Memorable Quotes shine a spotlight on moments of literary brilliance. - Interactive footnotes clarify unusual references, historical allusions, and archaic phrases for an effortless, more informed read.\n\nCategories: Fiction	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IJOxhT6KWQU/hqdefault.jpg	2025-11-21 08:50:26.4582+00	4230	\N
