20062	c5-jgMV8MAM	28559	My Perfect Daughter	Maddie is my savior. My angel. But could she also be a killer? The bond between Zoe and her adopted daughter Maddie is stronger than family. It’s stronger than blood. It was forged twelve years earlier - the night five-year-old Maddie helped Zoe escape the torture and imprisonment of her brutal, serial killer father. But you can’t erase the past, and when the police call Zoe late at night to tell her that one of Maddie’s classmates has died during a school camping trip, her first thoughts aren’t for the safety of her daughter. Instead, Zoe is ashamed to find herself wondering: Could Maddie have killed her? Because as much as she’s tried to raise the perfect daughter, Zoe can’t ignore the truth. Maddie’s biological father was a sadistic, sociopathic killer - and judging by her recent attitude and behaviour, perhaps the apple doesn’t fall far from the tree. As secrets and betrayal lead to Zoe’s perfect life crumbling around her, she doesn’t just question what kind of monstrous mother she must be to ever suspect her daughter capable of murder. She also starts wondering who Maddie’s next victim might be. My Perfect Daughter is the latest powerhouse psychological thriller from the “mistress of twists” Sarah A. Denzil - a must-read author for fans of Gillian Flynn, Frieda McFadden, and Paula Hawkins. What readers are saying about My Perfect Daughter: "What a whirlwind of a ride that was!" -- Goodreads reviewer "In conclusion a dark, intricate web of relationships, emotional trauma with a bit of serial killer action thrown in too. I LOVED IT. HIGHLY recommend!" -- Morbid Mama Reads "This book had me freaked out in my own house!" -- Goodreads reviewer "Wow! Just wow! I really don't know what to say! I picked this book up this morning & I just put it down so 11 & a half hours later I have finished it!" -- The Page Ladies "This book is a corker!!!"-- Goodreads reviewer\n\nCategories: Fiction	https://i.ytimg.com/vi/c5-jgMV8MAM/hqdefa